# A2A コネクタ 1.1.1: task-listener と task-stream-listener の SERVER、send-message の CLIENT、traceparent の受け渡し
app otel-a2a
prop mule.openTelemetry.tracer.exporter.sampler.type=always_on
GET /send | traceparent: 00-0af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-b7ad6b7169203331-01
GET /send
POST /agent | traceparent: 00-1af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-c7ad6b7169203331-01 | Content-Type: application/json | User-Agent: a2a-test | body: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"message/send","params":{"message":{"kind":"message","role":"user","messageId":"u-2","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"direct"}]}}}
POST /agent | traceparent: 00-2af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-d7ad6b7169203331-01 | Content-Type: application/json | body: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"message/stream","params":{"message":{"kind":"message","role":"user","messageId":"u-3","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"stream"}]}}}
GET /send?text=fail | traceparent: 00-3af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-e7ad6b7169203331-01
POST /agent | traceparent: 00-4af7651916cd43dd8448eb211c80319c-f7ad6b7169203331-01 | Content-Type: application/json | body: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"message/send","params":{"message":{"kind":"message","role":"user","messageId":"u-4","parts":[{"kind":"text","text":"fail"}]}}}
